Task

You are given a space separated list of nine integers. Your task is to convert this list into a X NumPy array.

Input Format

A single line of input containing  space separated integers.

Output Format

Print the X NumPy array.

Sample Input

1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9
Sample Output

[[1 2 3]
 [4 5 6]
 [7 8 9]]


 My answer -
 
import numpy as np
my_array = input().strip(" ").split()
my_array = np.array(my_array, dtype = int)
print (np.reshape(my_array,(3,3)))

Better answer - 

import numpy as np

my_array = np.array(input().split(), dtype=int)
print(my_array.reshape(3, 3))


